# Falsifiability (the demoted heuristic screen): an admitted grant whose GOVERNING
# estimate's p95 exceeds the advisory soft budget must surface — a smell, never a
# guarantee. (Round-3 W-05: the screen reads usedCostEstimate.)
@prefix ciops: <https://oip.law/ontology/ci-ops#> .
ciops:g-x ciops:usedCostEstimate ciops:ce-slow ; ciops:hasBudget ciops:b-x .
ciops:ce-slow ciops:p95Ms 1200000 .
ciops:b-x ciops:softP95BudgetMs 900000 .
